WEBVTT

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.720
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:30.324
| was born to be with you.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.598
The moment I awoke...

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.759
...prisms surrounded me.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:41.168
I'm here to love you now.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:45.034
I was born to hold you.

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:48.146
Lies and truths...

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:52.377
...are all within ourselves.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:57.349
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:58.914
...won't get to me.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.488
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:06.025
...can be ours once again!

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:10.613
Within the eyes
of a puppet on a string.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:14.450
Heart shaken by a dream
that someone else contrived for me.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:17.887
The courage to discard
the rusted screws...

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:22.610
...is starting to awaken inside of me.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:36.751
We all made up our minds, Otaru.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.527
The one thing we want to
protect the most, is you.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:42.359
We are marionettes.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:47.498
We were only puppets, but you
gave us hearts, and we thank you.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:52.339
Now, we will use these hearts
that you gave us to save Terra ll.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.146
| won't forget you, Otaru.

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:57.013
| won't forget you,
no matter what.

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.074
I'll never, ever forget you.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:03.282
I'll never forget your kindness,
and your strength.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.525
No matter what happens!

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.761
I love you, Otaru!!

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.871
There he goes.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.941
Lime...

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:31.743
Otaru... I'm sorry
| didn't stay with you!

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.577
I'm sorry I lied to you...!

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.692
Forgive me.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.398
You idiots...

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:48.992
YOU DAMNED IDIOTS!!

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:54.836
You'll Always Be There

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:08.621
What?!

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:10.352
LOVE?!

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.221
Thoughts of anger?!

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:15.086
Love and anger?
What are you talking about?

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:17.653
The Mesopotamia loves Lorelei.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.358
It knows that we have
come to take her away...

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:28.765
We are completely outclassed!
How are we going to get inside?!

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:30.673
What is it, Lime?!

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:32.973
I can hear her voice...

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.310
| can hear Lorelei...!

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:39.683
No! Stay back!
I can't let you die for me!!

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:41.083
You have to get away!!!

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:44.317
Don't worry. We're not
going to die for you.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.724
Please, Lorelei! Block
the ship's computer-...

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:50.388
...and make it hold
off the attack!

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.599
Please! Just for a second!

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:55.992
But, I...

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:08.170
- Big brother?!!
- It's all right, Yumeji!

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:13.313
GET TO IT ALREADY!

00:04:13.386 --> 00:04:15.013
DO YOU WANT TERRA Il
TO BE DESTROYED?!!

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:15.987
Lorelei!

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.523
Please!

00:04:25.131 --> 00:04:26.963
- Now, Hikozaemon!!
- Yes, sir!

00:04:52.025 --> 00:04:54.323
Good! Everybody,
board the Mesopotamia!

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:01.527
All right! We're in?!

00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:09.069
I have the location of the main
computer. Lorelei may be with it.

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:11.941
Okay, let's go, guys!
Let's go get Lorelei!

00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:13.371
- Let's!
-Yo!

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.346
LET'S GO!

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:27.185
The Mesopotamia will fight to
the bitter end to stop us, old man.

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:29.757
| am aware of that, Shogun.
If it comes down to that, I...

00:05:34.734 --> 00:05:36.964
A beam attack from
INSIDE the ship?!

00:05:37.036 --> 00:05:38.526
I'll get it!

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:49.115
Hoo, now they're coming in swarms!
This is what I call a warm welcome!

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:51.412
I'm so grateful that
I'm at a loss for words!

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:03.863
Here!

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:07.996
Lime!! Hop on!

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:15.640
This is convenient!

00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:17.938
And very comfortable!

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.478
Comfy, comfy, comfy!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:23.274
How...? How can
they smile like that?!

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:25.474
Ya-hoo!

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:28.680
Certain death is waiting for
them at their destination...

00:06:28.755 --> 00:06:31.690
Their eternal farewell with
their beloved, Otaru Mamiya...

00:06:31.758 --> 00:06:35.285
...is waiting for them. So, how?!
How can they keep smiling?!

00:06:36.763 --> 00:06:39.425
Otaru...
I'm very happy right now!

00:06:39.499 --> 00:06:43.959
I've never felt you more
with me than I do right now.

00:06:44.036 --> 00:06:46.095
That's right. You've
never been more with me.

00:06:59.118 --> 00:07:02.281
I don't know why,
but I feel so happy right now!

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:03.980
Same here.
I kind of feel like...

00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:06.057
...I'm the happiest guy
in the whole world!

00:07:06.159 --> 00:07:09.390
How come we're so happy?
We're not doing anything at all.

00:07:09.462 --> 00:07:12.056
We're not eating candy,
and we're not playing games...

00:07:12.131 --> 00:07:14.156
We're just standing here.

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:15.792
It's because the sky is blue!

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:18.296
If the sky is blue,
does that mean we're happy?

00:07:18.371 --> 00:07:20.169
It's not just the sky.

00:07:20.239 --> 00:07:23.800
We're happy because the clouds are so
white, and the forests are so green.

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:27.439
Hey, Otaru? What is "happiness"?

00:07:27.613 --> 00:07:29.638
Hey, do I look like
a wise man to you?

00:07:32.285 --> 00:07:33.377
Well...

00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:36.445
Happiness is when you think
it's great to be alive!

00:07:37.256 --> 00:07:39.122
It's great to be alive?

00:07:39.192 --> 00:07:40.557
Yup.

00:08:01.047 --> 00:08:02.173
Hey!

00:08:02.248 --> 00:08:05.809
You're right! Right now, I'm thinking
how great it is to be alive!

00:08:05.885 --> 00:08:06.408
See?

00:08:06.486 --> 00:08:09.387
| see. Happiness
is about being alive.

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:11.753
If you're alive, that
means you're always happy!

00:08:11.824 --> 00:08:13.292
Well, it's something like that!

00:08:15.461 --> 00:08:19.398
Otaru is the one who taught me
that blue skies meant happiness.

00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:23.261
He also taught me that the sound of
the streams, the fog on the plains...

00:08:23.336 --> 00:08:25.566
...the flowers without names
that bloom on the fields...

00:08:25.638 --> 00:08:28.608
...the sound the wind makes
the snow that falls on the streets...

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:32.405
...and that the smiles
on everybody's faces...

00:08:32.478 --> 00:08:34.105
...meant happiness.

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:38.060
Otaru is the one who breathed
life into we three marionettes...

00:08:38.084 --> 00:08:41.645
...and taught us
the joys of living.

00:08:43.055 --> 00:08:44.113
It was you, Otaru.

00:08:52.398 --> 00:08:54.332
We are alive.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:59.031
Right now, as we fight for Otaru
and everyone on Terra ll...

00:08:59.105 --> 00:09:03.099
...we are definitely alive!
Just that fact alone...

00:09:03.175 --> 00:09:06.110
...is more wonderful
than anything I can imagine!

00:09:10.149 --> 00:09:13.551
Even if death
should separate us...

00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:16.748
...the truth of every
glorious day we spent with you...

00:09:16.822 --> 00:09:18.449
...will never disappear!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.127
Otaru...
I can feel you with me!

00:09:23.195 --> 00:09:26.062
You're right beside me!
That's why...

00:09:26.132 --> 00:09:28.226
That's why I feel so happy!!

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:40.179
LIME, LOOK ouT!

00:09:48.421 --> 00:09:51.914
It was Otaru...
Otaru protected me.

00:09:55.528 --> 00:09:57.997
Please, please forgive them!

00:09:58.064 --> 00:10:01.659
They are innocent! Please try
to understand how they feel!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:14.644
The computer is just past
these doors. 200 meters ahead.

00:10:14.714 --> 00:10:16.375
The Mesopotamia
is deadly serious.

00:10:16.449 --> 00:10:18.645
I don't think it will let
us through without a fight.

00:10:18.718 --> 00:10:21.187
Maybe so, but I ain't
turning back now!

00:10:21.387 --> 00:10:23.788
Yes! This calls for an
all-out concentrated attack!

00:10:24.056 --> 00:10:26.047
Okay, let's do it!

00:10:44.243 --> 00:10:45.836
- Grampa!
- Shogun!

00:10:47.179 --> 00:10:49.079
Go, Lime... Leave us!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.718
GO!

00:10:56.689 --> 00:10:59.351
Goodbye, Lime... I will
atone for my sin...

00:10:59.425 --> 00:11:02.087
...of playing with your and
Otaru's hearts here and now!

00:11:03.696 --> 00:11:05.164
Goodbye, Grampa...!

00:11:25.251 --> 00:11:28.710
That's it. That's the
Mesopotamia's computer core.

00:11:29.388 --> 00:11:32.983
And also, it is the device that will
integrate with your maiden circuits.

00:11:33.059 --> 00:11:36.552
In other words, it is the system that
will produce an artificial Lorelei.

00:11:37.196 --> 00:11:40.689
Mesopotamia! Human males were
meant to bond with human females...

00:11:40.766 --> 00:11:43.861
...and machines were meant
to bond with other machines!

00:11:44.136 --> 00:11:46.935
We are the only ones who
can ease your loneliness...

00:11:47.006 --> 00:11:48.974
...and truly accept your love!

00:11:50.142 --> 00:11:54.101
80 please stop being so mad!
Please forgive everyone on Terra II!

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:57.477
In exchange,
we'll give our hearts to you!!

00:12:25.444 --> 00:12:26.912
Otaru...

00:13:04.517 --> 00:13:06.884
The Mesopotamia...
..is crying!

00:13:36.549 --> 00:13:39.814
"O-Taru"

00:13:39.885 --> 00:13:41.717
- Elementary School -

00:13:41.787 --> 00:13:44.518
And that sums it up!
So, you see, class...

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.651
...in a few years, the clones made
from Lorelei's cells will mature...

00:13:47.726 --> 00:13:51.253
...and the human female
will be restored to Terra I!

00:13:56.702 --> 00:13:57.779
HEY!"!

00:13:57.803 --> 00:14:00.033
Stop this ruckus,
you little mischief-makers!

00:14:00.105 --> 00:14:02.403
You had better do your homework,
or you won't grow up to be...

00:14:02.474 --> 00:14:04.909
...a beauteous, brilliant
adult like Yours Truly!

00:14:06.445 --> 00:14:09.745
Whatever! I wouldn't wanna be
a shirataki freak like you, anyway!

00:14:09.815 --> 00:14:13.308
If we gotta be like someone, I wanna
be a cool Japoness man like Otaru!

00:14:16.522 --> 00:14:18.718
You impertinent
little bed-wetters!!

00:14:18.791 --> 00:14:20.020
You will pay!
You will pay for this!

00:14:20.092 --> 00:14:21.719
As of tomorrow,
10 times the lessons!

00:14:21.794 --> 00:14:23.523
No, 100 times the lessons!!!

00:14:23.596 --> 00:14:25.724
THERE! HOW DO YA
LIKE THEM APPLES?!

00:14:26.432 --> 00:14:27.365
God, you're noisy...

00:14:27.433 --> 00:14:29.697
What bee's gotten into your
bonnet THIS time, Hanagata?

00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:33.934
Y-You should stay in bed, Otaru...
You shouldn't be walking around!

00:14:34.006 --> 00:14:36.270
All your stupid yelling woke me up.

00:14:36.342 --> 00:14:39.004
Hey, hey!!
Guess what, Otaru!

00:14:39.078 --> 00:14:41.012
Today, they're having
the grand opening...

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.447
...of the new Terra ll
Pioneer History Museum!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:46.714
The Terra ll
Pioneer History Museum...?

00:14:46.852 --> 00:14:48.718
What, don't you know?

00:14:48.787 --> 00:14:51.779
It's the one they were building where
the Japoness Pioneer Museum used to be!

00:14:51.857 --> 00:14:55.657
You're so dumb, Yumeji.
There's no way he couldn't know that!

00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:56.388
Oh, yeah!

00:14:56.462 --> 00:14:58.760
You're going,
aren't you, Otaru?

00:14:58.831 --> 00:15:00.492
Yeah, ¢'mon!
Let's go, let's go!!

00:15:04.837 --> 00:15:06.464
Otaru...

00:15:19.885 --> 00:15:21.763
Oh, Otaru! You're here!

00:15:21.787 --> 00:15:23.016
Hey there, Gen.

00:15:23.088 --> 00:15:24.487
Are you over your cold?

00:15:24.556 --> 00:15:25.853
Yeah.

00:15:28.627 --> 00:15:30.595
The opening ceremony's
about to start!

00:15:42.107 --> 00:15:43.336
It's Miss Lorelei!

00:15:43.409 --> 00:15:44.899
She's a total babe...!

00:15:45.444 --> 00:15:47.674
Welcome, everyone. Today,
I am proud to announce...

00:15:47.746 --> 00:15:50.977
...the completion of the
Terra ll Pioneer Museum.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.748
And, the arrival of
true peace upon Terra II!

00:15:55.321 --> 00:15:57.790
This is all the result
of your labors.

00:15:57.856 --> 00:16:00.257
The clones are
maturing on schedule.

00:16:00.626 --> 00:16:04.824
Very soon now, Terra Il will become a
normal world with both men and women.

00:16:08.033 --> 00:16:12.470
However, we mustn't forget...
...about marionettes.

00:16:16.775 --> 00:16:18.334
For a very long time...

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.869
...they performed the role of
the female on this all-male planet.

00:16:22.681 --> 00:16:25.241
They became your friends,
at times, your mothers...

00:16:25.317 --> 00:16:29.618
...and even your lovers, and
supported you through difficult times.

00:16:32.791 --> 00:16:34.259
Lord Faust...

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.322
What do you plan to do now?

00:16:37.396 --> 00:16:42.596
No matter where you decide to go,
we will never leave your side.

00:16:45.404 --> 00:16:48.339
Let's plant flowers...
..like we used to.

00:16:50.509 --> 00:16:52.170
Yes, let's... Lord Faust!

00:16:52.444 --> 00:16:54.208
We're going to make
this the planet...

00:16:54.279 --> 00:16:56.441
...with the most beautiful
flowers in the galaxy!

00:16:56.849 --> 00:17:00.410
It is my deepest wish that we
build the way for a bright future...

00:17:00.486 --> 00:17:03.131
...with man and marionette
in perfect harmony!

00:17:03.155 --> 00:17:05.556
Let us of fer them our thanks!
In particular...

00:17:05.624 --> 00:17:07.422
...let us thank those three!

00:17:14.466 --> 00:17:18.630
From this day onwards,
we must never forget their names.

00:17:18.704 --> 00:17:22.368
The marionettes with hearts...
The Saviors of Terralll...

00:17:22.441 --> 00:17:25.411
...the names of Lime,
Cherry, and Bloodberry.

00:17:28.847 --> 00:17:32.181
It's ironic... We had
the exact same mission...

00:17:32.251 --> 00:17:34.948
...yet we are still able
to be at Lord Faust's side.

00:17:36.889 --> 00:17:38.050
Lime...

00:17:38.123 --> 00:17:39.386
Cherry...

00:17:39.458 --> 00:17:40.926
Bloodberry...!

00:17:43.462 --> 00:17:45.089
What a load of crap.

00:18:12.257 --> 00:18:13.725
Lorelei...

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:18.797
Lorelei?!

00:18:18.864 --> 00:18:20.730
Hey... What are you doing?!

00:18:20.799 --> 00:18:23.063
We never wanted anyone to get hurt.

00:18:23.135 --> 00:18:26.070
Faust, leyasu, myself...

00:18:27.206 --> 00:18:30.335
We only wanted the revival
and prosperity of mankind...

00:18:30.776 --> 00:18:34.838
So, Faust and leyasu created two teams
of marionettes with maiden circuits...

00:18:35.013 --> 00:18:37.072
...and I created that system.

00:18:37.483 --> 00:18:40.714
Faust was unable to
mature the saber dolls...

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:44.051
...but leyasu waited patiently
for someone to arrive who could.

00:18:44.823 --> 00:18:46.382
And then, you came...

00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:50.725
...and you raised them well,
with all the love you had...

00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:52.730
...but I didn't realize...

00:18:52.798 --> 00:18:55.768
...didn't think of the terrible
sadness this would cause all of you.

00:18:56.835 --> 00:18:58.769
Otaru...

00:18:58.837 --> 00:19:01.863
Forgive me...
| was such a fool...!

00:19:02.908 --> 00:19:06.936
Please raise your head.
I'm not blaming you for it.

00:19:08.514 --> 00:19:09.811
Besides...

00:19:09.882 --> 00:19:11.941
...it won't bring them back.

00:19:19.558 --> 00:19:22.186
"O-Taru"
- Elementary School -

00:19:49.821 --> 00:19:51.799
Who are you?

00:19:51.823 --> 00:19:53.291
Who are you guys?

00:19:54.092 --> 00:19:56.060
We got him to understand.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:34.331
Otaru, what are you
doing up so early??

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:36.734
What, can't you tell?

00:20:36.802 --> 00:20:38.702
What's there to tell?

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:41.671
What are you doing,
making this much food?

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.708
We can't possibly eat all this...

00:20:43.775 --> 00:20:45.402
It's all right. Ow!

00:20:45.477 --> 00:20:47.741
Oh, see now? That's what happens when
you do things you don't usually do...

00:20:47.813 --> 00:20:48.974
Here, let me take over for you...

00:20:49.047 --> 00:20:50.446
I SAID IT'S ALL RIGHT!

00:20:50.515 --> 00:20:51.983
0-Otaru...

00:20:52.851 --> 00:20:54.580
| feel like cooking.

00:21:06.832 --> 00:21:10.462
| understand, Otaru... You keep
cooking until you feel better.

00:21:10.535 --> 00:21:12.401
I'll eat every bite of
the food you prepare...

00:21:12.471 --> 00:21:14.439
...no matter how many
helpings that may be!

00:21:14.506 --> 00:21:16.484
Oops! I'll need
the peptic acid!

00:21:16.508 --> 00:21:19.534
| came to this land to protect you.

00:21:20.045 --> 00:21:23.345
| was born to be with you.

00:21:23.715 --> 00:21:26.548
The moment I awoke...

00:21:27.352 --> 00:21:30.617
...prisms surrounded me.

00:21:31.056 --> 00:21:34.219
I'm here to love you now.

00:21:34.693 --> 00:21:38.027
I was born to hold you.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:41.200
Lies and truths...

00:21:41.833 --> 00:21:45.394
...are all within ourselves.

00:21:46.138 --> 00:21:50.166
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:21:50.575 --> 00:21:52.168
...won't get to me.

00:21:52.244 --> 00:21:55.373
Tenderness and caring...

00:21:55.914 --> 00:21:58.679
...can be ours once again!

00:21:59.484 --> 00:22:03.731
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:22:03.755 --> 00:22:07.502
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:22:07.526 --> 00:22:10.894
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:22:10.962 --> 00:22:15.559
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:22:22.107 --> 00:22:24.075
"O-Taru"

00:22:27.713 --> 00:22:29.943
- Otaru! - Master Otaru!
- Hey, Otaru!

00:22:30.449 --> 00:22:32.315
We're home, Otaru!!

00:22:32.818 --> 00:22:34.616
Hey, welcome back!

00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:43.692
Otaru, Otaru, Otaru!!

00:22:43.762 --> 00:22:44.752
Master Otaru!!

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:46.808
Otaru!

00:22:46.832 --> 00:22:49.028
Otaru, let's go out and play!
C'mon, ¢'mon, let's play!

00:22:49.101 --> 00:22:51.229
Aw, but I gotta go to work
right after breakfast...

00:22:51.303 --> 00:22:54.238
Oh, but Master Otaru,
what you have set out here...

00:22:54.306 --> 00:22:57.640
...is lacking one of the four food
groups! I'll make us another dish!

00:22:57.709 --> 00:22:59.473
Yeah! And before we
have breakfast, Otaru...

00:22:59.544 --> 00:23:01.376
...let's you and me sumo
wrestle in the nude!

00:23:01.446 --> 00:23:03.881
- Wha?
- OTARU! LOVERBOY'S HERE"!

00:23:03.949 --> 00:23:06.475
Ew, it's you,
you troublemaker!

00:23:06.551 --> 00:23:08.383
Hi, Hannie! Go home!

00:23:08.453 --> 00:23:12.185
ACK! I thought you became one
with the stars!

00:23:12.257 --> 00:23:15.716
Nope, but I'd be more than happy to
make a star outta YOU, Your Hana-ness.

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:21.265
Yup, it's another fine day
in Japoness!
